$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~25 min | Difficulty: Hard]] Three civilian ships and the frigate Halyard have twenty-two minutes to cross the Ragnar belt to the jump point. The Cylons will hit them from every side. Red flight escorts, and loses nobody.", -1)
$end_multi_text

